#: scenario3:scenario3_B371B5B2_5FFF_454D_BA8B_595B70E93E11
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 42afc3ef00d4eaded43baf4d4848232507fb278620e83e2bdfec894fae956ab6
#. default-sha256: 0edc5b3a7e5154a6950e9a4bfe956c8db08e2b59c2c1429d096c9bf6612785f0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B371B5B2_5FFF_454D_BA8B_595B70E93E11"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Though she looked outwardly uncertain as Maria led her "
"forward, hand around her wrist, the White-Haired Girl seemed to be enjoying herself on the inside."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫被玛利亚拽着胳膊的白发少女，⟪k:7⟫虽然流露出困惑的神情，⟪k:8⟫内"
"心却暗中作乐。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_96C33220_D592_454A_B65F_D0C71ABE015E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4a83d993548392a5a92deab81e4b733cec5e90045cd3572fda1686f0bd13e01
#. default-sha256: fc24b5840dbdc921081e690e0c6f655be71d86d760a0006e84171cb4ae82ab1e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_96C33220_D592_454A_B65F_D0C71ABE015E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Having spent her life without a single friend, she never dreamed the day would come when she "
"would find herself being dragged through the empty halls of a dark mansion by another woman."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫对于每天过着连闺中密友都没有的日子的她来说，⟪k:1⟫能出现像这样牵着她的手的人，⟪k:2⟫是她从来没"
"有想过的。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B03D2EAA_4E14_4CB5_A9AA_4080EB6B8B87
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b7407160e202b8459d83a8cc8c0be07e68f30eb71bb09e165228b99c577ad26
#. default-sha256: 67bea141839985d0c18345c6df8188e22eda3f07d66b1115fd1f327ecb87fd9e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B03D2EAA_4E14_4CB5_A9AA_4080EB6B8B87"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria’s presence seemed to shine a light upon the quiet corridor;⟪k:1⟫it would have been a "
"very lonely trek without her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫空无一人的夜下长廊。⟪k:1⟫这样冷清寂静的道路，⟪k:2⟫也因玛利亚的出现而宛如被光所照亮。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6B22A098_BBF3_42B9_A51D_965983BC3276
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b392354d8c54d60d89c2a06974efbbc929c73b7210038b53a0262034d305f991
#. default-sha256: 175ca967eb5a3da086b7a53d1b66b581b65866c55fe86e7af346aa8c4bcd517f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6B22A098_BBF3_42B9_A51D_965983BC3276"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria spun around, gave an impish smirk, and raised her pointer finger to her lips with a "
"soft “shhh.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫在黑暗中回过头的玛利亚，⟪k:1⟫恶作剧般笑着，「嘘—」地将指尖置于唇上。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D018C8FF_1783_4D5F_8135_D36CFD201481
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d34e9af2544b5276ed8d4341f80ef783acc47c6ab0908bed72bdcd0332e2648
#. default-sha256: db84cd548ffc7f4aee770594230c1baeb91327b1006d44729e7ab2885aa7367b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D018C8FF_1783_4D5F_8135_D36CFD201481"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sight of it caused the White-Haired Girl to chuckle quietly.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The two of them, "
"on their way to their secret, private ball,⟪k:3⟫were like two adolescent girls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫对于玛利亚的小动作，⟪k:1⟫她也不禁偷偷露出微笑。⟪k:2⟫沉浸在秘密夜游快乐中的两人，⟪k:3⟫就像少女"
"一般。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0A3870C9_338F_40B0_B7B4_6D14C7AB1CDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 683c2e4d412e13554c6be7d57b579123fb7ef967effd0c28b302781ee64ce1ca
#. default-sha256: 73881f76ad92a05740f27dcfe20f02259c4658be097f5ffecd401c44d304eeed
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0A3870C9_338F_40B0_B7B4_6D14C7AB1CDF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In short order, they arrived at the great hall."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫没过一会儿，⟪k:1⟫她们就来到了大厅。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9F571970_3E45_4B4A_8C72_011F9E50A799
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f8b74a04965490149695d387302a979f001e1180679a9491a2a25f2655148d4
#. default-sha256: 1c43f4e73c7f478423e2de2f77b3f0c2849598430117a86118863d29911ca887
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9F571970_3E45_4B4A_8C72_011F9E50A799"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫M-⟪k:10⟫My heart was pounding all the way "
"here..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫总、⟪k:10⟫总觉得，⟪k:11⟫刚才的一路上，⟪k:12⟫十分"
"紧张……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A3B0773F_61EB_42F7_9458_F05D7EADD71A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 974680dccaed71940c79e65146af86b2456adc847d8f24c80fd1a097fa87bac3
#. default-sha256: 61d6bb7d4fba254954275a38894455951684547e577403c5620871a7a43cde54
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A3B0773F_61EB_42F7_9458_F05D7EADD71A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What’s there to be nervous about?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It’s not like you’re breaking any rules."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫没必要紧张啦。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫反正我们又没做什么坏事。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_98B25F09_107D_47E3_9B12_B1FACF315A9D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a408c231d0dce28c670c6bd4755be83c8096e3daf6ae8764ed47295cbc1162e
#. default-sha256: b0e86360376417bfb4a2f0e21787253810718fa3acd3e9481336a6cefc2e9a9e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_98B25F09_107D_47E3_9B12_B1FACF315A9D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Only kids get in trouble for staying up late!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Once you’ve grown up, you’re "
"responsible for yourself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫夜里起来还要被教训，⟪k:2⟫又不是小孩子！⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫都已经是大人了，⟪k:5⟫当然是自己为自己的"
"行动负责。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74A56512_FC2F_438D_AC68_12043F3BEE23
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 205476d48649475887e613d460fcc48598dd825bee6784c9e276e39b7569d930
#. default-sha256: 6061a6ed40b261695148eef19588ef706fc586a9e724b22b673f35aabffd4a80
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74A56512_FC2F_438D_AC68_12043F3BEE23"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫呵呵……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5630319A_E42E_4BB9_993C_8890EEE2E419
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd3daec1bc3408dad2b5d7992485152059c97e50ac9c143c97a41bf443dc024f
#. default-sha256: 8862aaa9ea3885a47956be346e588f9a0a161c85dc694a0bd537853ad7daad95
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5630319A_E42E_4BB9_993C_8890EEE2E419"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I will say, though, that it seems rather odd for two women to dance together."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫话说起来，⟪k:2⟫女孩子一起跳舞，⟪k:3⟫有些不可思议呢？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_22E7B308_3F8A_43FB_909B_4BF232C2BBBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bac7b7e93f36b6cfae48724dd6c449a8ccdf260b4ed17abd49350bc6ad798981
#. default-sha256: 829d7e300fa55ba4960e28650bcf3dfa4ef523381286ca37da5042fae088bf42
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_22E7B308_3F8A_43FB_909B_4BF232C2BBBD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh? If you’re having a good time, what does it matter what’s between your legs? ⟪k:2⟫"
"Where I come from, there’re dances where families lock arms in a big ring and go ’round in "
"circles."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫有吗？⟪k:2⟫能觉得开心的话，⟪k:3⟫是男是女都无所谓吧。⟪k:4⟫在我的国家，⟪k:5⟫家里的人们会围"
"成一个圆，⟪k:6⟫转着圈跳舞。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_91608649_B4C7_49DA_B8D6_C1D554538A62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e3efc8199cf377cff74ef5fd2db8f645dacc8fcbfd5154283cfe3a37fcecba33
#. default-sha256: aa67138ef6334dca4e245f5c1a9e2468ab829d74ef6b328453d7c4494b7fa284
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_91608649_B4C7_49DA_B8D6_C1D554538A62"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So who says two girls can’t have some fun together?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫女孩子一起跳也很愉快哦！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74DC1BB5_F7FE_4D6D_896C_47F8BA040F7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48eed02e4d0d95e5e2e781e7c953056946392e7f94635c26fb99901eeb01a25b
#. default-sha256: 35c56082afb7a315e7e2fc9378d0805b981c461f7be2e81c3794c527fe2fcea7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74DC1BB5_F7FE_4D6D_896C_47F8BA040F7E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I imagine you had many good moments with your family."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫是呢，⟪k:2⟫你家里的话，⟪k:3⟫一定——是那样的呢。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6197179F_2AE7_4FD1_8DC5_4018C1690F18
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14b2f8fbfa106c2f61f4f14b281893f1b68a4c8901e3a132a5ac2aaf6b37a5c7
#. default-sha256: a6bd6ef75888a6932ab2a75d3c390945388b6c921b032c3a0e36bda9f9872ad7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6197179F_2AE7_4FD1_8DC5_4018C1690F18"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well... ⟪k:2⟫I don’t have a family anymore."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫嗯——⟪k:2⟫虽说我的家人都已经不在了。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_AD32D160_72C6_48A8_B74D_40637F3D35C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9eb6229edcc403533cfe0cc85074eebaf98bde0bac4bb01b14ed003d2136555a
#. default-sha256: 9e22d08f17d6979c4c9f6cd0ed2410067b5db8fcf144f876f59a1915a662760d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AD32D160_72C6_48A8_B74D_40637F3D35C2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫哎………？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5DA78352_6D4A_40CD_A473_4534DF9A8168
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 631c6cfc663fa4d0685903632c6f41e750dd3f3d309fcfdb7a28946cd8d6a8ed
#. default-sha256: f28a81d7a01602fe33bbf3dd165f78bada5a91a35ed56365e32bd494816ec05d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5DA78352_6D4A_40CD_A473_4534DF9A8168"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All right, so I’ll show you how it’s done.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Watch carefully, ’cause you’re up "
"next!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫那么，⟪k:2⟫我先做个示范。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫要好好记清楚哦，⟪k:5⟫因为下次就轮到夫人您了！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4DD16ADC_4FB9_4721_8CF2_8988C5C4C967
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a186a92fac4059d43bc14859dbc21fa2af1d49692d9bbbb35e2b64b65507837
#. default-sha256: 00146af67ef5d282fcf98d1687150c1a71f75d55183daaf1bcb3f6ea261bb54f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4DD16ADC_4FB9_4721_8CF2_8988C5C4C967"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah... ⟪k:2⟫o-⟪k:3⟫okay."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫啊……⟪k:2⟫好、⟪k:3⟫好的。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E18EA77E_74A9_4366_B4E6_101505AA7A55
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d047c8d76ba4db1c955e10963cc4928913cd037bfb377f64f4fd165e40d06c7
#. default-sha256: 2cf60487743ac7a50753921d59d5b40ed0b332d11c3105f2b55650bfd5d4aa3a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E18EA77E_74A9_4366_B4E6_101505AA7A55"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫With a wide grin on her face, Maria began whistling softly and prancing "
"across the floor with an energetic rhythm."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫玛利亚满面笑容地轻轻吹响口哨，⟪k:4⟫跳起轻快的舞步。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_80FCE4CE_1F91_4B28_8EB6_3061F2DDA2CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e3be7b09ec181983cadee273ddbc4d5b829bdda2e548622b83d5ab58b124da6
#. default-sha256: 6c267a4fae789ae8439aae2078656a02c13eb5e29075c6464c8cde3223e212d0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_80FCE4CE_1F91_4B28_8EB6_3061F2DDA2CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was not the kind of complicated dance you’d see at fancy parties."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这舞步和社交界流行的那种不同，⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫并没有多么复杂难学。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A817D415_E705_47F0_9D5F_AA7C63C87B16
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce883dc6509d0d2a3a58c6c1366d3e51708ac1ba0736d321b9650a69917c4c93
#. default-sha256: 0c932ab71c7476b46e334294d6dfc6b15542566d06b87b32601d67c2946f4181
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A817D415_E705_47F0_9D5F_AA7C63C87B16"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The motions were simple, flowing, unembellished—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫a folk dance, I suppose you "
"might call it.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫She seemed to be improvising a little bit as well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫只是简单的动作连接而成的纯朴舞蹈。⟪k:1⟫这就是所谓的民族舞蹈吗？⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫或许舞步中也加了她独"
"创的改动。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_BC8F8D24_6B49_44C2_A27C_CD4E18A8D890
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39ce66c0097fc5f9e381a3851c1323bc80bd1bee93636c3338b1b1f3c0541c39
#. default-sha256: 4ae728704bc57860c69ffd77fb7b94abc8705824c8547d909ff23357ebeb22ad
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BC8F8D24_6B49_44C2_A27C_CD4E18A8D890"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But in any event, the White-Haired Girl was captivated."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫即便如此，⟪k:1⟫白发少女还是看得入了迷。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3350D509_3709_4309_B77D_4BE260D61F59
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92f59e78890ebee15e466a21903e36c00f2caa84c1f80cd3fb4bf58f7be21110
#. default-sha256: 26f3d8141845dd4964cc7892ca0494cb3aa55a7c85e559871be7a14c51ca4161
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3350D509_3709_4309_B77D_4BE260D61F59"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite it being a sequence of steps anyone could replicate,⟪k:1⟫Maria breathed life into "
"the dance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫虽说是谁都能学得来的动作，⟪k:1⟫因为舞蹈者是玛利亚的缘故，⟪k:2⟫跃动感便满溢而出。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_AC32B8C2_19F3_40EC_84F6_5567F5E9D0C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 408f03bc96dd7549a2c63e38c1e9b27f9e22d34d4b7b1dbb6cf1a5cfc10c10ce
#. default-sha256: da1c0c16423d7a0160e2278594ded32d237262523a0a695146d551b3ce9faefc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AC32B8C2_19F3_40EC_84F6_5567F5E9D0C1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was neither as lithe as an acrobat nor as light on her feet as a professional dancer."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫那绝不是舞蹈家般行云流水的舞步。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫也不是杂技演员般敏捷灵巧的动作。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_478B7A2B_1580_4F75_97B3_84FF6131E8F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5694990d9e3f623f59f84827b54ec226fd64e2a7bc7b0ea355939667e268946
#. default-sha256: 2ff7f23d607f11cd78f2863a36afde67a53cc9b7b999256fc352d254d433e2f7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_478B7A2B_1580_4F75_97B3_84FF6131E8F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was her own, lively, beautiful self."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫那是，⟪k:1⟫充满她的生命力的、⟪k:2⟫美妙的舞动。"

